<title>POLAND: OLAWA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>OLAWA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.35 vs   0.22</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.58 vs   0.37</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.48 vs   0.34</p>
<p> Sales		    4.87 vs   3.71</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.36 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.25 vs   1.98</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.86 vs   1.74</p>
<p> Sales		   18.62 vs  14.91</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish non-ferrous metals smelter is</p>
<p>Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
